  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " is why. Inside it is a form of the word for what.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Я же не ем мучное.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I don't eat flour products.' Now let's inspect the words: ",
